mpi4pyscf 0.2 (2018-8-21)
-------------------------
Bind to pyscf-1.6
* Added
  - molecular RHF and UHF methods
  - molecular RKS and UKS methods
  - PBC df module (including FFT, AFT, GDF, MDF)
  - molecular RMP2
  - molecular RCCSD


